      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nThe {0} is north from here,\nand its rear gate is connected to\nthe northern Prontera Fields.\nLet me mark the castle on your mini-map.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向导]\n{0}就在北边，它的后门连接着北边的普隆德拉野外。\n我会在您的小地图上标记王宫的位置。\n{1}"
