      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nThe ^FF5400Hypnotist^000000\nhelps beginner adventurers\nto reset their skills.\nHe has moved to Izlude, Prontera's satellite town to the southeast.\nWould you like to check any other locations?\n{0}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向导]\n^FF5400催眠师^000000可以帮助新手冒险者重置技能。\n他已经搬到了普隆德拉东南方的卫星城镇依斯鲁得岛。\n您还想查看其他地点吗？\n{0}"
